{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33981","headline":"鲁望以轮钩相示缅怀高致因作三篇 二 · 皮日休","name":"鲁望以轮钩相示缅怀高致因作三篇 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"一线飘然下碧塘，溪翁无语远相望。\n蓑衣旧去烟披重，篛笠新来雨打香。\n白鸟白莲爲梦寐，清风清月是家乡。\n明朝有物充君信，㰂酒三缾寄夜航。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皮日休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_33981.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33981","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}